									<p class="text-base text-gray-500 dark:text-white/50">INACAP Santiago Centro</p>
								</div>
								
								<p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-600 dark:text-white/70 mb-8 max-w-2xl font-light">
									Formación integral en ciencias de la computación, abarcando arquitectura de software, bases de datos avanzadas, algoritmia y metodologías ágiles.
								</p>
								
								<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
									<span class="px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-xs font-mono text-gray-600 dark:text-white/60 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-white/[0.03] border border-gray-200 dark:border-white/5 group-hover:bg-gray-200 dark:group-hover:bg-white/[0.06] transition-colors">CS</span>
									<span class="px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-xs font-mono text-gray-600 dark:text-white/60 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-white/[0.03] border border-gray-200 dark:border-white/5 group-hover:bg-gray-200 dark:group-hover:bg-white/[0.06] transition-colors">Arquitectura</span>
									<span class="px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-xs font-mono text-gray-600 dark:text-white/60 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-white/[0.03] border border-gray-200 dark:border-white/5 group-hover:bg-gray-200 dark:group-hover:bg-white/[0.06] transition-colors">Datos</span>
								</div>
